      ],
      "body": "Many of these jobs are just the verb plus -er: work → worker, sing → singer, dance → dancer, play → player. The unit adds the words around the job — company, meeting, career, interview."
    },
    {
      "title": "You will use these words in",
      "frames": [
        "This is a …",
        "He is a …",
        "I am a …",
        "I have a …",
        "He is my …"
      ],
      "note": "Czech práce is two words. job is countable: I have a good job. work is not — never a work: I have a lot of work.",
      "note_cz": "práce = job (počitatelné, a job) i work (nepočitatelné, nikdy a work)."
    }
  ],
